// emath-epic-machine-fjxh.15 negative seed: pack source injecting parser
// keywords.
//
// Seeded silent-success: a field_pack body claims a `keywords:` section
// (lexer/keyword injection) and exports a cell. A mutant whose install
// tooling consumed the unadmitted pack source anyway (or that silently
// ignored the injection section) would look like a successful
// install-without-rebuild while the pack smuggled parser surface in.
// The law: injection refuses at ADMISSION (closed section table) and
// install only consumes admitted pack data.
# expect: refuse E-SYN-101 (section `keywords` is not admitted for kind `field_pack`)

package community

emath field_pack injector:
    exports:
        cell softmax
    keywords:
        add match
